vllm-mlx (TimotejLabsky fork)
==============================

This is a fork of waybarrios/vllm-mlx maintained for the
personal-infrastructure homelab at github.com/TimotejLabsky/personal-infratructure.

Upstream:
  https://github.com/waybarrios/vllm-mlx  (Apache License 2.0)

Original vLLM inspiration:
  https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm  (Apache License 2.0)

This fork carries a series of local patches on top of upstream commit
7e304840713c2abce8ea1fb40cb960a740c01ce2. Each patch is a separate
git commit on the `main` branch with the prefix `patch:`. The branch
is periodically rebased on waybarrios/main to pick up upstream changes.

Patch series (as of fork creation, 2026-05-19). Full rationale,
measurements, and upstreaming notes for each patch are in PATCHES.md.

  1.  patch: bugfixes                    - load_model_with_fallback fix + model-name validation
  2.  patch: reasoning-effort            - OpenAI reasoning_effort field, maps "none" → no thinking
  3.  patch: stream-finish-reason        - finish_reason="stop" fallback for natural EOS
  4.  patch: llm-mode-kv-cache           - LLM-mode routes through system-KV cache path
  5.  patch: system-kv-hybrid-guard      - VLLM_MLX_DISABLE_SYSTEM_KV kill switch
  6.  patch: system-kv-hybrid-aliasing   - shallow-copy snapshot lists (fixes hybrid drift)
  7.  patch: system-kv-metrics           - wire system_kv_cache into Prometheus gauges
  8.  patch: incoming-reasoning-content  - preserve reasoning_content on incoming messages
  9.  patch: cache-extended-prefix       - extend cache to full conversation history + grow-on-HIT
  10. patch: status-system-kv            - /v1/status includes system_kv_cache

Modifications are marked in source files with `EXTENDED_PREFIX_MARKER`
comments where appropriate. The full change history is in `git log`.

